- Positioning: the script positions based on the icon container; if your layout has z-index or overflow containers, we may need to mount the tooltip higher in DOM (e.g., to a top-level portal) to avoid clipping.
- Styling: colors, spacing, fonts — I left neutral defaults. If the design team prefers brand tokens, I can update them.
- Simpler path: if a styled tooltip isn’t required, the single <title> element is less risky and keeps behavior consistent across platforms.

